  <div class="gline"><span class="g pt-non"><i></i><em>VCP 패턴</em> <b>무형</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>수축깊이</em> <b>9.6%</b></span><span class="g vt"><i></i><em>거래량</em> <b>중간</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>돌파전</em> <b>-8.4%</b></span><span class="g na" title="건강관리기술 — F2T3 85.6667 · 구성 11 · 상위3 458870, 071200, 035610 · 표시 전용(매매 무관)"><i></i><em>비주도</em> <b>34/77</b></span></div><div class="gline"><span class="g"><i></i><em>Stage</em> <b>Stage2 (0.36yr, B1)</b></span><span class="g warn"><i></i><em>AI</em> <b>4/10</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>매출 감속</em> <b>X</b></span></div>
