  <div class="gline"><span class="g pt-con"><i></i><em>VCP 패턴</em> <b>수축</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>수축깊이</em> <b>6.2%</b></span><span class="g vt"><i></i><em>거래량</em> <b>안마름</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>돌파전</em> <b>-1.8%</b></span><span class="g na" title="항공사 — F2T3 73.0 · 구성 7 · 상위3 180640, 003490, 020560 · 표시 전용(매매 무관)"><i></i><em>비주도</em> <b>48/77</b></span></div><div class="gline"><span class="g"><i></i><em>Stage</em> <b>Stage2 (0.59yr, B3)</b></span><span class="g can"><i></i><em>AI</em> <b>6/10</b></span><span class="g fail"><i></i><em>매출 감속</em> <b>O</b></span></div>
