  <div class="gline"><span class="g pt-pul"><i></i><em>VCP 패턴</em> <b>눌림</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>수축깊이</em> <b>12.9%</b></span><span class="g vt"><i></i><em>거래량</em> <b>안마름</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>돌파전</em> <b>-7.1%</b></span><span class="g" title="전자장비와기기 — F2T3 97.6667 · 구성 62 · 상위3 017900, 009150, 222800 · 표시 전용(매매 무관)"><i></i><em>주도섹터</em> <b>5/77</b></span></div><div class="gline"><span class="g"><i></i><em>Stage</em> <b>Stage2 (0.38yr, B2)</b></span><span class="g fail"><i></i><em>AI</em> <b>2/10</b></span><span class="g na" title="kr_not_in_universe"><i></i><em>매출 감속</em> <b>NA</b></span></div>
