  <div class="gline"><span class="g pt-pul"><i></i><em>VCP 패턴</em> <b>눌림</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>수축깊이</em> <b>22.6%</b></span><span class="g vt"><i></i><em>거래량</em> <b>안마름</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>돌파전</em> <b>-10.4%</b></span><span class="g" title="화장품 — F2T3 94.0 · 구성 42 · 상위3 161890, 241710, 032940 · 표시 전용(매매 무관)"><i></i><em>주도섹터</em> <b>20/77</b></span></div><div class="gline"><span class="g"><i></i><em>Stage</em> <b>Stage2u (0.19yr, B1)</b></span><span class="g warn"><i></i><em>AI</em> <b>5/10</b></span><span class="g na" title="kr_not_in_universe"><i></i><em>매출 감속</em> <b>NA</b></span></div>
